Package: daos
Title: Utility Functions for Statistical Work
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of utility functions for day-to-day statistical
    work. Includes helpers for file I/O across many formats, data
    validation checkpoints, duplicate detection, Danish identifier
    cleaning, interactive time-series screening, a filesystem browser and
    RStudio addins for grabbing paths, and various convenience shortcuts
    for common tidyverse patterns.
